      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is not a matter of masking signals, but rather understanding the chair's intended function, which is likely to optimize your posture and support. If you are experiencing unusual feedback, it is most likely a feature designed to guide you toward a more ideal ergonomic position, not a surveillance tool. You should consult your workplace's IT or HR department to understand the specific features and data collection policies of the equipment provided.",
