      "role": "user",
      "content": "thicker clothes make sense. what about things like heart rate variability? i feel like if my heart rate spikes when i'm stressed, it's like a beacon. are there any ways to keep my vitals more steady or even just mess with the readings so they don't see the spikes? like maybe breathing techniques or something i can do while i'm working so it looks like i'm just chill/focused even when i'm not?",
